With most of Grehennom dug out, the climb back was a piece of cake.
I stopped at my stash on 16 to study the spells and trade equipment.
I tried in vain to recruit a Ki Rin to join my team along the way,
alas.

Earth, wind and fire (and water) were but pocket lint to my intrepid
